  "/prompts/blocks/attachment-doc-excerpt.md": "---\nnotes: |\n  A document attachment with its excerpt truncated. `excerpt` is body with\n  the leading whitespace indented by two spaces so it lines up under\n  `Excerpt:`. `suffix` is \"\" or \"\\n  [excerpt truncated]\".\nversion: \"1\"\n---\n\n- [doc] \"{title}\" — {why}\n  Excerpt:\n  \"\"\"\n  {excerpt}\n  \"\"\"{suffix}\n",
